id: unrelenting
name: Unrelenting
order: 18
description: >
  Thanks to your monstrous power, you continue to get back up no matter how many times you’ve been knocked down.
text: >
  Unrelenting: Thanks to your monstrous power, you continue to get back up no matter how many times you’ve been knocked down.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Score of your Steadfast Checks by 1.
  (2)-[Passive]: For each Health Threshold you are below, increase your Soak Value and Surgency by 1(T).
  (3)-[Triggered/Defeated]: Use a Healing Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1)
steadfast.dice += 1;
# (2)
soakValue.perThreshold += 1(T);
surgency.perThreshold += 1(T);

# (3) Offered on the Defeated card: the Surge Maneuver out of sequence, a Healing Surge (chat.mjs lionsHeart).
[triggered/defeated, effect 3]
lionsHeart();
